# Cloudflare Pages serves this from the build root (Docusaurus copies static/* there).
# Conservative hardening for a static docs site. CSP is intentionally omitted for
# now (Docusaurus ships inline bootstrap scripts; a strict policy needs testing).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
